{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18310170","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18310170","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1831017001:1":{"text":"ずっとずっと昔、まだ幼い生者だった頃、お母さんがよく海底都市の話をしてくれたの……","source_cn":"很久很久以前，在我还是个年幼的生者的时候，我的妈妈曾经...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB1D28492BF6640C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1831017002:1":{"text":"大海の真ん中、深い深い海の底には、巨大で華やかな宮殿があって、たくさんの魚の住人たちが暮らしていた。","source_cn":"在大海中央的深海里，存在着一座巨大的、华丽的宫殿，里面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FC3A9AB22F5E356","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1831017003:1":{"text":"ある日、嵐に遭った漁師が遭難して、偶然にもその宮殿に迷い込んだ。彼は陸から持ってきた品物と引き換えに、たくさんの真珠を手に入れた。","source_cn":"曾经有遭遇暴风雨的渔民落难，意外进入了那座城市。他用从...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB58A3AED578A0562","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1831017004:1":{"text":"――その後、彼は真珠のおかげで大儲けをし、裕福な暮らしを送ったとさ。","source_cn":"后来，他靠着那些珍珠发了大财，过上了富足的生活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CFAA44A477B0AE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1831017005:1":{"text":"ねっ、ロマンチックな話だと思わない？","source_cn":"多么浪漫的故事，是不是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94281EA0E0C3E1F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","docu